			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Land element submodules for build freshness\n\nUpdate all Land/Element submodules to their latest revisions, maintaining consistency across the editor's native backend, UI services, and build tooling.\n\nWind and Cocoon advance their generated artifact timestamps — catalog version dates and RouteManifest.ts compilation timestamp — to match today's codegen cycle. Output and Rest normalize shell script whitespace (tabs to 2-space indentation, pipe alignment, case branch formatting) to enforce script maintenance conventions. Mountain simplifies URI parsing in the ProvideCodeLenses IPC handler by adopting centralized Utilities::Params helpers. Sky and Worker advance to their latest submodule heads with no recorded functional changes in this sync.\n\nAll editor components remain build-consistent with no functional regressions.",
